ck_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.6, 4.6.1, 4.6.2.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.1.stable - Fedora Linux 43 (KDE Plasma Desktop Edition) on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - Mesa Intel(R) UHD Graphics (CML GT2) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-10850H CPU @ 2.70GHz (12 threads) - 30.97 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe \"icon\" property for TabContainer tabs can be set to a custom texture, and during debug it seems to work perfectly.\n\nHowever when going to view an export of the project, the icons seem disappear from the tab container tabs.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Create an empty project in Godot 4.6.1/2.\n- Create a new \"Control\" scene.\n- Add a TabContainer node to the scene.\n- Add 2 or more child Control nodes to the TabContainer.\n- Navigate to the TabContainer node & modify the tab properties for the tabs to set a custom icon.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[MRP.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25891777/MRP.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"phosxd","id":167900279,"node_id":"U_kgDOCgH0dw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/167900279?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/phosxd","html_url":"https://github.com/phosxd","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phosxd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phosxd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phosxd/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phosxd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phosxd/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phosxd/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phosxd/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phosxd/events{/privacy}","received